WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.941 --> 00:00:14.722
Bobby met Ms.

2
00:00:14.762 --> 00:00:17.363
Folani in the hallway on his way to Kids Central.

3
00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:19.984
"Hello, Bobby," she said.

4
00:00:20.004 --> 00:00:23.325
"I saw your mom the other day at the grocery store.

5
00:00:24.166 --> 00:00:25.927
She is so cheerful and nice.

6
00:00:25.947 --> 00:00:28.948
Do you have anything special planned for Mother's Day?"

7
00:00:31.644 --> 00:00:32.705
Bobby swallowed.

8
00:00:32.725 --> 00:00:37.006
"Oh. Mother's Day When is that?"

9
00:00:37.227 --> 00:00:38.327
Ms. Folani laughed.

10
00:00:38.347 --> 00:00:41.168
"It's next Sunday, Bobby!

11
00:00:41.268 --> 00:00:42.709
You have 12 days.

12
00:00:44.149 --> 00:00:46.030
I'm sure you'll think of something sweet!"

13
00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:59.616
"Maybe we'll make something for Mother's Day in Kids Central," Bobby thought as he opened the gym door.

14
00:01:02.764 --> 00:01:07.747
While Miss Shelly was setting up the tables, Bobby asked Jason what he was doing for his mom

15
00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:08.627
on Mother's Day.

16
00:01:08.647 --> 00:01:13.010
"My dad and I are going to bake her a cake," Jason said.

17
00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:15.431
"Why? What are you doing?"

18
00:01:16.271 --> 00:01:17.712
Miss Shelly blew her whistle.

19
00:01:18.733 --> 00:01:22.475
"Please put away your things and come over," she called.

20
00:01:23.335 --> 00:01:25.336
Miss Shelly passed out paper cups.

21
00:01:27.077 --> 00:01:32.853
"Today we are going to turn these paper cups into flowerpots," said Miss Shelly.

22
00:01:32.873 --> 00:01:36.136
"How do we turn them into flowerpots?"

23
00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:37.657
Izzie wanted to know.

24
00:01:37.677 --> 00:01:40.939
"By planting flower seeds in them!"

25
00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:42.301
said Miss Shelly.

26
00:01:42.321 --> 00:01:45.983
"What kind of flower seeds are we planting?"

27
00:01:46.204 --> 00:01:46.944
Bobby asked.

28
00:01:49.506 --> 00:01:51.148
Moms always like flowers.

29
00:01:52.088 --> 00:01:53.590
Maybe this could be his present.

30
00:01:54.831 --> 00:01:56.292
Miss Shelly held up a bag.

31
00:01:56.312 --> 00:01:59.034
"Marigolds," she said.

32
00:01:59.915 --> 00:02:01.296
Then she showed them a picture.

33
00:02:02.172 --> 00:02:06.734
"Marigolds are small plants with green leaves and yellow-orange flowers."

34
00:02:06.754 --> 00:02:11.816
"Those would be perfect for my mom, don't you think?"

35
00:02:12.677 --> 00:02:14.077
Bobby whispered to Jason.

36
00:02:14.918 --> 00:02:15.718
"I guess so.

37
00:02:16.458 --> 00:02:18.239
How about getting her a video game?"

38
00:02:18.599 --> 00:02:19.420
Jason said.

39
00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:26.082
"Jason, moms like chocolate, not video games," Izzie said.

40
00:02:27.243 --> 00:02:29.304
Miss Shelly tapped the table with her pencil.

41
00:02:30.124 --> 00:02:34.265
"First use your pencil to poke a hole in the bottom of your paper cup.

42
00:02:34.865 --> 00:02:38.766
That way when we water the plants, the extra water can drain out.

43
00:02:39.967 --> 00:02:42.187
Next fill the cup with soil.

44
00:02:42.968 --> 00:02:46.228
Please go and dip your cup into that box of soil over there."

45
00:02:47.149 --> 00:02:49.489
Miss Shelly pointed to a box on the floor.

46
00:02:54.751 --> 00:02:58.372
we dig a little hole with our fingers and put the seeds in, right?"

47
00:02:58.612 --> 00:02:59.232
Izzie said.

48
00:03:00.048 --> 00:03:02.349
She had planted flowers with her mom before.

49
00:03:02.369 --> 00:03:05.651
"Exactly!" Miss Shelly said.

50
00:03:07.331 --> 00:03:09.112
She gave each kid a few seeds.

51
00:03:16.155 --> 00:03:18.356
that we give them water and sun.

52
00:03:20.297 --> 00:03:21.938
And we wait for them to grow!"

53
00:03:21.958 --> 00:03:25.379
"Wait for them to grow?"

54
00:03:25.659 --> 00:03:26.920
Bobby thought nervously.

55
00:03:27.776 --> 00:03:31.277
He had forgotten that it took a long time for seeds to turn into plants.

56
00:03:32.517 --> 00:03:33.278
"Miss Shelly?"

57
00:03:33.618 --> 00:03:34.298
Bobby asked.

58
00:03:35.078 --> 00:03:37.639
"Will our marigolds bloom by Mother's Day?"

59
00:03:37.659 --> 00:03:39.919
"I'm afraid not, Bobby.

60
00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:44.200
It takes a month or two for them to grow," Miss Shelly answered.

61
00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:49.622
"Oh no Bobby's heart sank.

62
00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:52.343
Now he had nothing to give his mom for Mother's Day.

63
00:03:52.363 --> 00:03:54.043
"I know!

64
00:03:54.283 --> 00:03:56.904
You could give the pot to her next Sunday anyway.

65
00:03:57.692 --> 00:04:01.935
And then when the flowers bloom, it will be like Mother's Day all over again!"

66
00:04:02.175 --> 00:04:02.836
Nina said.

67
00:04:04.537 --> 00:04:05.497
Bobby smiled.

68
00:04:05.678 --> 00:04:06.958
What a great idea!

69
00:04:07.639 --> 00:04:08.960
That's just what he'd do.
